              "message": "Feat: Tools - Add unified Linux release packaging script #7047 (#7049)\n\nSingle repo-local CLI for Linux release packaging: .AppImage, .deb\nand .tar.xz from a `make release` build in one pass.\n\n- all|tar|deb|appimage targets, optional devbuild mode producing\n  linux-devbuild-DD-MM-YYYY.tar.xz for devbuilds.bforartists.com\n- resolves repo root from the script location; build dir, output dir\n  and appimagetool path overridable via env\n- prunes stale bin/<version> dirs derived from BKE_blender_version.h\n- strips makesdna/makesrna/datatoc/msgfmt/shader_tool/zstd_compress\n- clean AppRun without version-pinned BLENDER_SYSTEM_* paths\n- deb ships AppStream metainfo to usr/share/metainfo\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
